$$
in $ D[\kappa,1] $, as $ N \to \infty $. The process $ \mathcal{U_2 $ has continuous sample paths w.p. $1$.
\item[(ii)] Assume $ \{ Y_n \} $ is a strictly
stationary $ \alpha $-mixing $ I(0) $ process such that $ E Y_1^{4 \nu} < \infty $ and
